title: "jaxgsa: Global Sensitivity Analysis in JAX"
abstract: >-
  jaxgsa computes global sensitivity indices entirely in JAX, providing Sobol,
  RS-HDMR, PCE, eFAST, DGSM, HSIC, and PAWN methods with GPU/TPU acceleration.
